<title>JAPAN: Matsushita-Kotobuki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsushita-Kotobuki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		188.03		vs	  175.27</p>
<p> Operating	    9.53		vs	    1.15</p>
<p> Current	     11.52		vs	    3.15</p>
<p> Net		    4.80		vs	    1.97</p>
<p> EPS		   30.36 yen	  vs	   12.45 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    158 million	  vs	 158 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.75 yen	  vs	    6.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita-Kotobuki Electronics Industries Ltd specialises in video equipment production.</p>
</text>
